#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/allocate/index.rst:260
msgid ""
"NOTE: Memory allocated in this way doesn't go through torch allocator. "
"Instead, it's allocated directly by the corresponding backend APIs, like "
"cudaMalloc. We recommend allocating workspace in Torch side and pass it to "
"the kernel via arguments, which is managed under the hood by the framework. "
"This API is mainly for testing purposes and some specific purposes."
msgstr ""

